<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-GAUTENG LIONS BEAT NATAL 42-8 IN SUPER 12 MATCH.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-GAUTENG LIONS BEAT NATAL 42-8 IN SUPER 12 MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gauteng Lions beat Natal 42-8 (halftime 16-3) in their Super 12 rugby union match at Ellis Park on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Gauteng Lions - Tries: Dawie du Toit (2), Jopie Adlam, Joe Gillingham, Jannie van der Walt. Conversions: Edrich Lubbe (4). Penalties: Edrich Lubbe (3).</p>
<p>Natal - Try: Cabous van der Westhuizen. Penalty: Gavin Lawless.</p>
